---
Manage data export integrations

Usage: vendo integrations [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list            List all integrations
  get             Get integration details
  sync            Trigger a manual sync
  refresh-source  Check source-data availability for a window and trigger top-up imports for missing ranges
  pause           Pause an integration
  resume          Resume a paused integration
  delete          Delete an integration (soft delete)
  create          Create a new integration (source → destination pipeline)
  update          Update an integration
  help            Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help            Print help
